                "author_name": "Romain ROUYER",
                "fallback": "Romain ROUYER commented on Hack The Brain Paris: \"Appel à participation pour un Workshop + <http:\/\/BR41N.IO|BR41N.IO> en Italie en octobre\n\n___\nHi everyone! The 2019 IEEE SMC Brain-Machine Interface Systems Workshop will take place in Bari, Italy from October 6-9, 2019. This year we’ll have a <http:\/\/BR41N.IO|BR41N.IO> Brain Hackathon, a number of industry-student events, keynote speakers (Dr. Maria Chiara Carrozza and Dr. Febo Concotti, already confirmed, more to come), panels, and peer-reviewed papers that will appear on IEEExplore after presentation.\n\nThe Call for Special Sessions is out and proposals are due February 20th. Please see the workshop website for more details: <http:\/\/musaelab.ca\/bmi19\/smc2019_bmi.html>\n\nFull papers are due March 31st. Hope to see many of you in Bari!\"",
                "text": "Appel à participation pour un Workshop + <http:\/\/BR41N.IO|BR41N.IO> en Italie en octobre\n\n___\nHi everyone! The 2019 IEEE SMC Brain-Machine Interface Systems Workshop will take place in Bari, Italy from October 6-9, 2019. This year we’ll have a <http:\/\/BR41N.IO|BR41N.IO> Brain Hackathon, a number of industry-student events, keynote speakers (Dr. Maria Chiara Carrozza and Dr. Febo Concotti, already confirmed, more to come), panels, and peer-reviewed papers that will appear on IEEExplore after presentation.\n\nThe Call for Special Sessions is out and proposals are due February 20th. Please see the workshop website for more details: <http:\/\/musaelab.ca\/bmi19\/smc2019_bmi.html>\n\nFull papers are due March 31st. Hope to see many of you in Bari!",
